      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The control",
      "items": [
        "Same architecture and weights: DiffusionGemma 26B vs Gemma 4 26B A4B",
        "Both at 8-bit MLX, same Mac, same mlx-vlm runner",
        "Only diffusion-vs-autoregressive differs — that is the point"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Measured",
      "items": [
        "Throughput = output tokens / end-to-end wall time",
        "TTFT, where diffusion structurally loses (a whole block must denoise first)",
        "Actual denoising steps used — the entropy-bound sampler early-stops",
        "run_benchmark.py calls judge.py and metrics.py independently — neither imports the other"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Result",
      "items": [
        "Diffusion ~43 tok/s; autoregressive ~61 tok/s on the same Mac",
        "The 1,000+ tok/s headline is real on an H100 and does not reach Apple Silicon",
        "30 prompts x 5 timed trials; raw data in results/run-7"
